OL,3,AWho could replace Jensen Huang as
OL,4,ANvidia's permanent chief executive?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia is now facing a scenario few
OL,7,Fwould have considered until very
OL,8,Frecently - a future without Jensen
OL,9,FHuang.
OL,11,FThe chief executive and co-founder of
OL,12,Fthe AI chip-making giant is at the
OL,13,Fcentre of a major scandal over reports
OL,14,Fof extramarital affairs, one of which
OL,15,Fwas with a woman suspected of being a
OL,16,FChinese spy.
OL,18,FOn Thursday, Nvidia's board announced
OL,19,Fhe had resigned effective immediately.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
