OL,3,AWho could replace Jensen Huang as
OL,4,ANvidia's permanent chief executive?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe will be replaced, for now, by
OL,7,FNvidia's chief financial officer
OL,8,FColette Kress.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/18
