OL,3,ANvidia's CEO was the rock star of AI
OL,4,Abefore his dramatic unravelling
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn recent years, Jensen Huang has been
OL,7,Friding high on the crest of the AI wave
OL,8,Fas his company Nvidia became one of the
OL,9,Fmost valuable in the world.
OL,11,FIt only took a few days for it to all
OL,12,Fcome crashing down.
OL,14,FBack-to-back revelations of two affairs
OL,15,Finvolving the CEO, including a romantic
OL,16,Frelationship with an alleged Chinese
OL,17,Fspy, upended his seemingly untouchable
OL,18,Fstatus as a leading tech figure and led
OL,19,Fto his resignation from the company he
OL,20,Fhelped form.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
