OL,3,ADJ Tim Westwood denies two more sexual
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer BBC Radio 1 and Capital Xtra DJ
OL,7,FTim Westwood has denied two more sexual
OL,8,Foffences during a court hearing.
OL,10,FHis latest pleas of not guilty mean he
OL,11,Fnow denies a total of 17 charges
OL,12,Fconcerning allegations by nine women
OL,13,Fbetween 1983 and 2016.
OL,15,FThe 69-year-old pleaded not guilty to
OL,16,Findecently assaulting a teenage girl
OL,17,Faged 16 or 17 in Hammersmith and
OL,18,FFulham, west London, in 1991 at
OL,19,FSouthwark Crown Court on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
